                                "sense_id": "b844736e-d018-3609-839f-bfd11dd432e5",
                                "text": "The granite for his monument lies unquarried nor is its erection needed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "972a3b63-f2cf-46f0-af0e-5b507cfc05c7",
                                "sense_id": "b844736e-d018-3609-839f-bfd11dd432e5",
                                "text": "He touched the heights of the Misty City and the sea-fog that had walled it in through the night as with walls of unquarried marble--albeit the eaves had dripped in the darkness as after a summer shower--and anon the opaque vapors dissolved and fled away."
                            }
